[00:16.74]Because we are imperfect, O Jehovah,
[00:22.46]The inclination of our heart is flawed.
[00:30.80]There is a sin that easily ensnares us—
[00:38.36]A lack of faith in you, the living God.
[00:46.05](Chorus)
[00:46.20]Give us more faith, we beg of you, Jehovah.
[00:54.18]Please help us out according to our need.
[01:02.24]Give us more faith, according to your mercy,
[01:09.70]That we may honor you in word and deed.
[01:35.42]Apart from faith, no one can fully please you.
[01:41.49]We must believe our faith will be repaid.
[01:49.74]And as a shield, our faith provides a refuge.
[01:57.52]We face the future firm and unafraid.
[02:05.43](Chorus)
[02:05.58]Give us more faith, we beg of you, Jehovah.
[02:13.98]Please help us out according to our need.
[02:22.00]Give us more faith, according to your mercy,
[02:29.68]That we may honor you in word and deed.
